<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35142" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνδελεχ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
		(v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δολιχός</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>continuous, perpetual</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνήμη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					718a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λειτουργία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					15.156
				</span></i>
			 (
				Sup.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῦρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>1 Es.</u>
					6.24
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυσίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.569
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				587
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Per.</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			; of persons, <i>plodding, persevering</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φροντισταὶ σύντονοι καὶ ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				p.52
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Mar.</u>
				13
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ περὶ τοὺς πόνους ἐ</span>.
				<i>perseverance</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				6
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-Χῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Critias
					19.5
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				539d
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Diod.Com.
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				521
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1028.33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ex.</u>
				29.38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Fab.</u>
				19
			</span></i>, etc.--Freq. confused with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντελεχής</span> in codd., as <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
			</span></i> l.c.</div>
